// ## 3. Out-of-scope

// The 10 requirements cover architecture, performance, security,
// documentation, and tooling. They do not cover:
//   - Project vocabulary (see RULES.oot §1.16 — Vocabulary Standards).
//   - Versioning protocol (see RULES.oot §1.21 — Semantic Versioning).
//   - Auto-release discipline (see RULES.oot §1.24).

